cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Icebrew in your research, software, or computational experiments, please cite it."
title: "Icebrew: A Configurable, Local-First Computational Research Toolkit"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nath
    given-names: Som Subhro
    affiliation: "Independent Developer"
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/SomSubhroN/Icebrew"
keywords:
  - computational research
  - data analysis
  - statistics
  - artificial intelligence
  - local-first computing
  - reproducible research
  - Python
abstract: >-
  Icebrew is a configurable, local-first computational research toolkit
  designed to unify data analysis, statistical workflows, visualization,
  sentiment analysis, local AI experimentation, media processing, and
  reproducible computational workflows within a modular command-line
  environment.
